{"actor":{"type":"system"},"content":{"attachment":{"commandMode":"task-notification","prompt":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a61781e63a0a098a3</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01A3ScTy9QEMV15eCgM9KbF3</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-evintunador-repos-evintunador-conversation-ledger/224d1239-00ba-4ddb-8117-5a487d569b0d/tasks/a61781e63a0a098a3.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Survey actor types on machinery kinds\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result># Machinery-kind actor inventory across cledger adapters\n\n## Shared mechanism (`src/adapters/records.ts`)\n\nFour builder functions produce the four kinds. Only one accepts a caller-supplied actor type:\n\n| Builder | Kind | `actorType` | file:line |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `sessionStateDraft` | `session_state` | **hardcoded `\"system\"`**, no parameter | `records.ts:140` — `recordDraft(ctx, \"session_state\", \"system\", ...)` |\n| `activityDraft` | `activity` | **parameterized**, `actorType = \"system\"` default | `records.ts:151-158` — `function activityDraft(..., actorType = \"system\")` → `recordDraft(ctx, \"activity\", actorType, ...)` |\n| `contextInjectionDraft` | `context_injection` | **hardcoded `\"system\"`**, no parameter | `records.ts:169-182` — `recordDraft(ctx, \"context_injection\", \"system\", ...)` |\n| `fileSnapshotDraft` | `file_snapshot` | **hardcoded `\"system\"`**, no parameter | `records.ts:226-243` — `recordDraft(ctx, \"file_snapshot\", \"system\", ...)` |\n\n`recordDraft` (`records.ts:60-71`) attaches real git identity (`actor.id`/`actor.display`) only when `actorType === \"human\"`.\n\n## Per-adapter, per-kind inventory\n\n| Adapter | Kind | Source type/subtype | `actor.type` | file:line | Derived or constant? |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|