nversations reachable from the\n82\t                                           current branch; --all pushes the whole ledger,\n83\t                                           --rev scopes to another branch/commit\n84\t  cledger transport-push [remote]         pre-push hook entrypoint (installed automatically):\n85\t                                           pushes the ledger ref alongside git push, scoped to the\n86\t                                           refs being pushed (read from git's pre-push stdin;\n87\t                                           falls back to HEAD); scan findings hold back only the\n88\t                                           ledger unless transport.strict\n89\t  cledger scan [--all|--rev R] [--paranoid]   scan local events for potential secrets (CI-friendly:\n90\t                                           exits 1 if any finding, 0 otherwise); default scope is\n91\t                                           every local event, --rev restricts by reachability\n92\t  cledger review [--paranoid] [--context N]   step through every outstanding finding interactively:\n93\t                                           one screen per distinct span, match highlighted in\n94\t                                           context, one key to allow (here or globally), redact\n95\t                                           everywhere, or skip. HUMANS ONLY, plain terminal —\n96\t                                           refuses inside an agent session and without a TTY.\n97\t  cledger inspect <event-id-prefix> [--context N] [--reveal] [--stdout] [--force]\n98\t                                           show a finding with real surrounding context (default 400\n99\t                                           chars each side). Writes to a file outside the repo and\n100\t                                           refuses to run inside a coding-agent session — reports\n101\t                                           never print content, because reprinting it re